{
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Arouse.TheDemonessPerforms": "The demoness performs a series of arcane gestures, visibly glowing with an unholy aura. Your body feels warmer."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Attract.SheTeasesHerBody": "[say: Do you feel that,] she teases. Her body seems almost as if it glows in the [sun]light, and you feel a warm comfort within you. [say: Do you feel how wonderful it is to gaze upon my body?]"
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Attract.Text": "[pg-][b:Your lust resistance has been lowered!]"
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Attract.TheSuccubusBeckonsYou": "The succubus beckons you toward her. [say: Worship me,] she commands, her beckoning motion alight with a magical aura."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Blind.FortunatelyYouBlinked": "Fortunately you blinked just as the luminous shine was starting, saving you from its blinding sting."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Blind.ShePresentsHer": "She presents her open palm for a moment, followed immediately by a flash of bright light! "
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Blind.YouShutYour": "You shut your eyes on reflex, but when you open them, everything is dark. It'll take some time to readjust."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Charge.TheDemonTwirls": "The demon twirls her whip around and catches the bulk of it in her hands. Focusing, she casts a spell, and the coiled leather shimmers with energy, the metallic tip sparking with electricity."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Flight.HerWingsExtend": "Her wings extend out and thrust toward you, blasting you with a gust of wind as she skips back and jumps into the air. The ivory succubus is flying now."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Land.TheSuccubusHolds": "The succubus holds out her wingspan, maximizing surface area as she glides gently down toward the ground."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Avoid0": "it near enough to feel the air rush."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Avoid1": "ringing your [ears] with the sound of its snap."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Avoid2": "You just barely manage to avoid the deadly display in time."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Block0": "harmlessly against your [shield]."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Block1": "but the strike is deflected."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Block2": "The shining tip strikes against your [shield] with a deafening crack."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Hit0": "the metal wedge painfully against your body."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Hit1": "striking hard enough to nearly embed the silver tip into your [if (isnaked) {flesh|[armor]}]."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Hit2": "The elegant motion ends with the tip of her weapon whirling directly into you."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Lead0": "The succubus twirls her whip for a moment before flicking it at you, snapping "
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Lead1": "The ivory demon lashes you with her whip, "
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Lead2": "Her hands raise over her head as she does a twirl, her whip spiraling around her, before gracefully leaping and lashing at you. "
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Lash.Zero": "{0}"
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.LockUp.TheDemonessS": "The demoness's arm rotates around in a fluid motion before her hand clenches, and suddenly you find your joints grinding to a halt painfully."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Tease.TheDemon'sTailSnakes": "The demon's tail snakes up from between her legs, lifting her skirt while still robbing you of a clear sight of her nethers. The tip sways back and forth teasingly, the succubus entirely aware of the angle."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Tease.TheSuccubusShakesHer": "The succubus shakes her hips, ruffling her sheer skirt as it flashes glimpses of her crotchless panties."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Tease.TurningHerHeelThe": "Turning on her heel, the ivory succubus arches backward and presents herself like a dancer. [say: A perfect body must be enjoyed, not only by its owner, Champion,] she says in a sultry voice."
  "Combat.IvorySuccubus.Whitefire.WispsOfFire": "Wisps of fire dart between the succubus's fingers before suddenly the flames are dancing across you. She snaps and they flourish into an ethereal inferno!"
}
